  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  input: "The world has spoken - and now it\u2019s your turn to decide.          
    You\u2019ve seen what\u2019s at stake, you\u2019ve learned how the forces of
    our planet collide, and the decisions ahead won\u2019t be easy. But remember
    you\u2019re not just a player. You are the final voice in a global struggle for
    balance.                           Step forward. Take your seat. Let your judgement
    shape the future. Are you ready?"
  tmp_Font: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4d97113c8b5ad8e4ea187a70f904ee99, type: 2}
